<title>USA: R.P Scherer, Glaxo sign pact.</title>
<headline>R.P Scherer, Glaxo sign pact.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.P. Scherer Corp said Tuesday is signed clinical trial supply and technology transfer agreements to make two new chemical entities under development by Glaxo Wellcome Plc.</p>
<p>Both development products will be manufactured at Scherer's new pharmaceutical facility at Beinheim, France.</p>
<p>Scherer, an international developer and manufacturer of drug delivery systems, is a major producer of soft gelatin capsules, also called softgels.</p>
